# The .ics files the demo serves are CRLF by specification (RFC 5545), and git
# on Windows would otherwise normalise them to LF on the way in. Keep them
# byte-exact. calendar/data/series.ics is deliberately not here: it is a source
# file the generator parses, not one that is served.
demo/public/downloads/*.ics -text
www/demo/downloads/*.ics -text
